<section class="pr-faq"><h2>Questions <em>&amp; answers</em></h2><details><summary>How do I send my files?</summary><p>After you place a request we send you an upload link. Export every track as WAV from the same start point, without effects on the master bus.</p></details><details><summary>When do I pay?</summary><p>You pay 50 % to start and the other 50 % only when you approve the result. Payments are accepted by card (Stripe) and PayPal. Prices are in EUR.</p></details><details><summary>What counts as a revision?</summary><p>One revision is one list of changes sent in a single message.</p></details><details><summary>What if I am not happy with the result?</summary><p>We keep working within your revisions until the track sounds right. Need more changes? Extra revisions can be added at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Do I keep all rights to my music?</summary><p>Yes. For mixing, mastering, remixes, co-production and ghost production all rights stay with you. Our name is never credited unless you want it.</p></details></section>
<p class="pr-foot">Need something that is not listed? <a href="/contacts/">Contact us</a> — we will prepare an individual offer.</p>
